# JavaFX Calculator

A simple desktop calculator built with Java 17 and JavaFX.
The GUI (FXML, designed in Scene Builder) is separated from the calculation logic, which is covered by JUnit tests.

## Features
- Addition, subtraction, multiplication, division
- Chained calculations
- Division by zero handling
- Delete and Clear buttons

## Project structure
- `calculator.logic` - calculation logic (no GUI code)
- `calculator.gui` - JavaFX controller
- `src/main/resources/calculator/gui` - FXML layout and CSS

## Requirements
- JDK 17
- Maven

## Run
mvn javafx:run

## Test
mvn test